# Downloaded reference corpora. PROVENANCE.md's first repository rule is
# "never commit a full third-party corpus" — this is what enforces it.
#
# Works fetched here are consulted to CHECK entries, never redistributed. That
# holds even for public-domain ones: the inventory ships derived facts under
# CC BY, and shipping someone else's whole dictionary alongside them would make
# the licence of the result a question nobody should have to ask.
corpora/*
# …except the note explaining why the rest is ignored.
!corpora/README.md

# Editor and OS scratch
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
